  "description": "Source generator for decorator pattern boilerplate code in C#.\n\nWhen implementing the decorator pattern in C#, it requires adding boilerplate code for every interface that needs to support decorators, namely the abstract class. Boilerplate is tedious to write and error-prone. This source generator solves this problem by automatically generating the abstract class. It only needs to be told which interfaces it should generate the abstract class for.",
